    q: 'What makes a tile selectable or free?',
    a: 'A tile is free if it has no tile resting on top of it AND at least one of its left or right edges is open. If a tile is buried under another, or boxed in on both sides, it is blocked and cannot be matched until you clear what is pinning it. You win by matching free pairs until the whole layout is gone.',
